// The Memory feature's public API. Cross-feature, import ONLY this barrel (#1545).
//
// `bsc memory` (`~/.base-studio-code/memory.db`) is the store that catches what a session LEARNS but
// has no plan item for — a finding, a decision, a lesson, a parked thread — as a TYPED GRAPH rather
// than a log: each memory carries edges to the record, plan ref or other memory it is about.
//
// The store is deliberately SEPARATE from the code-record graph (`graph/algorithms.json`): memory is
// high-churn user data and must never enter the committed store the build compiles.
